record/account/group occurrences where present."",""prerequisite"":""Valid hierarchy, trailer layout and unsigned count"",""reference"":""https://developer.huntington.com/enterprisepayments/docs/bai2; BAI Version 2 Technical Reference Manual October 2005 p.25 and Appendix A; docs/BAI2_SOURCE_SCOPE.md (source versus candidate assumptions)"",""evidence"":""tests/bai2.test.ts; tests/bai2-signs.test.ts; tests/browser/bai2.spec.ts; demo-files/bai2/manifest.json; source sample arithmetic and independent synthetic sign/totals oracle, no independent bank approval""},{""id"":""huntington-bai2-public-2026-r1.non-empty-source"",""description"":""Nonempty source in trusted BAI2 context."",""ruleClass"":""flat-file-structure"",""severity"":""ERROR"",""applicability"":""Selected Huntington BAI2 candidate; per-record/account/group occurrences where present."",""prerequisite"":""Valid hierarchy; subject logical layout"",""reference"":""https://developer.huntington.com/enterprisepayments/docs/bai2; BAI Version 2 Technical Reference Manual October 2005 p.25 and Appendix A; docs/BAI2_SOURCE_SCOPE.md (source versus candidate assumptions)"",""evidence"":""tests/bai2.test.ts; tests/bai2-signs.test.ts; tests/browser/bai2.spec.ts; demo-files/bai2/manifest.json; source sample arithmetic and independent synthetic sign/totals oracle, no independent bank approval""}],""exclusions"":[""CANDIDATE only, not complete BAI/X9 or bank conformance. No Product/SC/FT, rules/fixtures approval, Production activation or hosted ReadMe acceptance."",""Candidate transport: printable ASCII (decoded as strict UTF-8), no BOM/tabs, one physical record per LF/CRLF/CR-separated line, optional one final separator. Mixed separators admitted. Blocked, translated, encrypted and concatenated transports are not qualified."",""Structured 88 continuation at comma field boundaries and opaque 16 text continuation are supported after any record, including 88. Scalar splits are unsupported. Physical counts include continuations of headers and trailers; no universal maximum 80-column length is imposed."",""Only omitted funds fields, omitted physical length/block size, USD/omitted currency and omitted/2 as-of modifier are qualified. Nonempty funds layouts, declared blocking, other currencies/modifiers/versions and unlisted three-digit type codes receive UNSUPPORTED with no verdict."",""Guide defaults are not fixed customer identities. Dates use a disclosed 2000–2099 interpretation and integers retain a local 40-digit limit. Base BAI Version 2 signs apply: status/control optional plus or minus; summary/detail optional plus only, including signed zero. No verified Huntington sign override or bank acceptance. No decimal scaling, real account/routing ownership, balance economics, net-debit/credit reconciliation, historical duplication or external verification."",""Controls sum reported numeric summary and detail amounts once; omitted optional amounts contribute no numeric operand. Counts include the opening and closing physical records. Dependent total/count checks are not evaluated when their numeric/layout prerequisites are malformed."",""CSV conversion, funds availability correctness, custom OpenText layouts, delivery scheduling/entitlements and current-day modifier semantics are excluded; omitted modifiers do not establish reporting mode.""],""checks"":[{""ruleId"":""bai2.characters"",""state"":""passed"",""findingOrdinals"":[]},{""ruleId"":""bai2.framing"",""state"":""passed"",""findingOrdinals"":[]},{""ruleId"":""bai2.continuation"",""state"":""passed"",""findingOrdinals"":[]},{""ruleId"":""bai2.hierarchy"",""state"":""passed"",""findingOrdinals"":[]},{""ruleId"":""bai2.layout"",""state"":""passed"",""findingOrdinals"":[]},{""ruleId"":""bai2.file-header"",""state"":""passed"",""findingOrdinals"":[]},{""ruleId"":""bai2.group-header"",""state"":""passed"",""findingOrdinals"":[]},{""ruleId"":""bai2.account-id"",""state"":""passed"",""findingOrdinals"":[]},{""ruleId"":""bai2.currency"",""sta