cs/wires-payments-automation; docs/CSV_WIRE_SOURCE_SCOPE.md"",""evidence"":""tests/csv-wire.test.ts; tests/browser/csv-wire.spec.ts; demo-files/csv-wire/manifest.json; synthetic local evidence, no bank approval""},{""id"":""wire.country"",""description"":""Populated country fields belong to the frozen uppercase ISO alpha-2 list."",""ruleClass"":""flat-file-structure"",""severity"":""ERROR"",""applicability"":""Selected CSV Wire USD candidate and qualified positional rows."",""prerequisite"":""Framed row with exact positional layout and qualified scenario; optional checks only when applicable"",""reference"":""https://developer.huntington.com/enterprisepayments/docs/wires-payments-automation; docs/CSV_WIRE_SOURCE_SCOPE.md"",""evidence"":""tests/csv-wire.test.ts; tests/browser/csv-wire.spec.ts; demo-files/csv-wire/manifest.json; synthetic local evidence, no bank approval""},{""id"":""wire.bank"",""description"":""Required primary type/code, ABA prefix/checksum, beneficiary 11-character BIC/country and paired optional ABA intermediaries."",""ruleClass"":""flat-file-structure"",""severity"":""ERROR"",""applicability"":""Selected CSV Wire USD candidate and qualified positional rows."",""prerequisite"":""Framed row with exact positional layout and qualified scenario; optional checks only when applicable"",""reference"":""https://developer.huntington.com/enterprisepayments/docs/wires-payments-automation; docs/CSV_WIRE_SOURCE_SCOPE.md"",""evidence"":""tests/csv-wire.test.ts; tests/browser/csv-wire.spec.ts; demo-files/csv-wire/manifest.json; synthetic local evidence, no bank approval""},{""id"":""wire.charges"",""description"":""International charges BEN or OUR; domestic charges are reserved/empty."",""ruleClass"":""flat-file-structure"",""severity"":""ERROR"",""applicability"":""Selected CSV Wire USD candidate and qualified positional rows."",""prerequisite"":""Framed row with exact positional layout and qualified scenario; optional checks only when applicable"",""reference"":""https://developer.huntington.com/enterprisepayments/docs/wires-payments-automation; docs/CSV_WIRE_SOURCE_SCOPE.md"",""evidence"":""tests/csv-wire.test.ts; tests/browser/csv-wire.spec.ts; demo-files/csv-wire/manifest.json; synthetic local evidence, no bank approval""},{""id"":""wire.fx"",""description"":""Optional rate decimal syntax, fewer than 10 significant digits and 10 characters including the point (conservative N10 interpretation); contract ID has C16 length check, no external authorization."",""ruleClass"":""flat-file-structure"",""severity"":""ERROR"",""applicability"":""Selected CSV Wire USD candidate and qualified positional rows."",""prerequisite"":""Framed row with exact positional layout and qualified scenario; optional checks only when applicable"",""reference"":""https://developer.huntington.com/enterprisepayments/docs/wires-payments-automation; docs/CSV_WIRE_SOURCE_SCOPE.md"",""evidence"":""tests/csv-wire.test.ts; tests/browser/csv-wire.spec.ts; demo-files/csv-wire/manifest.json; synthetic local evidence, no bank approval""},{""id"":""huntington-csv-wire-public-2026-r1.non-empty-source"",""description"":""Nonempty source in trusted CSV Wire context."",""ruleClass"":""flat-file-structure"",""severity"":""ERROR"",""applicability"":""Selected CSV Wire USD candidate and qualified positional rows."",""prerequisite"":""Framed row with exact positional layout and qualified scenario; optional checks only when applicable"",""reference"":""https://developer.huntington.com/enterprisepayments/docs/wires-payments-automation; docs/CSV_WIRE_SOURCE_SCOPE.md"",""evidence"":""tests/csv-wire.test.ts; tests/browser/csv-wire.spec.ts; demo-files/csv-wire/manifest.json; synthetic local evidence, no bank approval""}],""exclusions"":[""CANDIDATE only: no bank conformance, Product/SC/FT or rules/fixture approvals, Production activation or actual hosted ReadMe acceptance."",""Guide-backed positional USWIRE (54 fields) and INT (58 fields). INT is limited to USD, beneficiary country US/CA and account type OTHER. Non-USD timing, IBAN/applicability, other beneficiary countries and intermediary SWIFT (guide says 13 characters) are UNSUPPORTED with no verdict."",""Candidate transport: printable ASCII decoded as strict UTF-8, no BOM/tabs, quoted comma-separated fields including empty fields, doubled-quote escapes, LF/CRLF and optional final separator. Mixed LF/CRLF admitted. Embedded field line breaks, headers and custom mappings are unqualified. The guide samples use unquoted empty fields, contradicting its all-fields-quoted rule; candidate follows the explicit rule."",""Date checks capture the current UTC date once per run and record it in the date result. At most 30 calendar days ahead for domestic/INT USD. No past-date restriction is supplied by the guide. Bank time zone, holidays, cutoffs, CAD +1/other +2 business days are not qualified."",""Decimals require a point and digits with at most 2 domestic/3 international fractional digits and fewer than 18 significant digits. Leading zeros excluded, trailing fractional zeros included. Zero is admitted; guide gives no positive minimum. FX rate uses fewer than 10 significant digits and a 10-character N10 cap including its decimal point as a conservative candidate interpretation; no separate fractional scale is invented."",""Routing prefix/checksum and 11-character beneficiary BIC/country syntax are local checks, not live directory, bank/account existence, ownership, sanctions, entitlement, bank-populated address or acceptance checks. ISO country membership uses a frozen IANA 249-code snapshot."",""Optional intermediary code/type fields are paired as a disclosed candidate decision; no undocumented dependency is imposed on bank-populated names/addresses. FX Desk contract/rate authorization, exchange-rate calculations, settlement, duplicates and payment execution are excluded. No file data leaves the local worker or is persisted."",""Resource limits: existing 25 MB bytes, 8,000,000 decoded units and worker deadline; 100,000 retained row/cell nodes, 64 fields per row and 1,000,000 source units per field. Checks aggregate repeated violations and retain the first failing location without echoing field values.""],""checks"":[{""ruleId"":""wire.characters"",""state"":""passed"",""findingOrdinals"":[]},{""ruleId"":""wire.framing"",""state"":""passed"",""findingOrdinals"":[]},{""ruleId"":""wire.layout"",""state"":""passed"",""findingOrdinals"":[]},{""ruleId"":""wire.required"",""state"":""passed"",""findingOrdinals"":[]},{""ruleId"":""wire.length"",""state"":""passed"",""findingOrdinals"":[]},{""ruleId"":""wire.reserved"",""state"":""passed"",""findingOrdinals"":[]},{""ruleId"":""wire.date"",""state"":""passed"",""findingOrdinals"":[]},{""ruleId"":""wire.amount"",""state"":""failed"",""findingOrdinals"":[7]},{""ruleId"":""wire.debit-account"",""state"":""passed"",""findingOrdinals"":[]},{""ruleId"":""wire.account-type"",""state"":""passed"",""findingOrdinals"":[]},{""ruleId"":""wire.address"",""state"":""passed"",""findingOrdinals"":[]},{""ruleId"":""wire.country"",""state"":""not-evaluated"",""findingOrdinals"":[]},{""ruleId"":""wire.bank"",""state"":""passed"",""findingOrdinals"":[]},{""ruleId"":""wire.charges"",""state"":""not-evaluated"",""findingOrdinals"":[]},{""ruleId"":""wire.fx"",""state"":""not-evaluated"",""findingOrdinals"":[]},{""ruleId"":""huntington-csv-wire-public-2026-r1.non-empty-source"",""state"":""not-evaluated"",""findingOrdinals"":[]}]}","","","",""
