y country US/CA and account type OTHER. Non-USD timing, IBAN/applicability, other beneficiary countries and intermediary SWIFT (guide says 13 characters) are UNSUPPORTED with no verdict."",""Candidate transport: printable ASCII decoded as strict UTF-8, no BOM/tabs, quoted comma-separated fields including empty fields, doubled-quote escapes, LF/CRLF and optional final separator. Mixed LF/CRLF admitted. Embedded field line breaks, headers and custom mappings are unqualified. The guide samples use unquoted empty fields, contradicting its all-fields-quoted rule; candidate follows the explicit rule."",""Date checks capture the current UTC date once per run and record it in the date result. At most 30 calendar days ahead for domestic/INT USD. No past-date restriction is supplied by the guide. Bank time zone, holidays, cutoffs, CAD +1/other +2 business days are not qualified."",""Decimals require a point and digits with at most 2 domestic/3 international fractional digits and fewer than 18 significant digits. Leading zeros excluded, trailing fractional zeros included. Zero is admitted; guide gives no positive minimum. FX rate uses fewer than 10 significant digits and a 10-character N10 cap including its decimal point as a conservative candidate interpretation; no separate fractional scale is invented."",""Routing prefix/checksum and 11-character beneficiary BIC/country syntax are local checks, not live directory, bank/account existence, ownership, sanctions, entitlement, bank-populated address or acceptance checks. ISO country membership uses a frozen IANA 249-code snapshot."",""Optional intermediary code/type fields are paired as a disclosed candidate decision; no undocumented dependency is imposed on bank-populated names/addresses. FX Desk contract/rate authorization, exchange-rate calculations, settlement, duplicates and payment execution are excluded. No file data leaves the local worker or is persisted."",""Resource limits: existing 25 MB bytes, 8,000,000 decoded units and worker deadline; 100,000 retained row/cell nodes, 64 fields per row and 1,000,000 source units per field. Checks aggregate repeated violations and retain the first failing location without echoing field values.""],""checks"":[{""ruleId"":""wire.characters"",""state"":""passed"",""findingOrdinals"":[]},{""ruleId"":""wire.framing"",""state"":""passed"",""findingOrdinals"":[]},{""ruleId"":""wire.layout"",""state"":""passed"",""findingOrdinals"":[]},{""ruleId"":""wire.required"",""state"":""passed"",""findingOrdinals"":[]},{""ruleId"":""wire.length"",""state"":""passed"",""findingOrdinals"":[]},{""ruleId"":""wire.reserved"",""state"":""passed"",""findingOrdinals"":[]},{""ruleId"":""wire.date"",""state"":""passed"",""findingOrdinals"":[]},{""ruleId"":""wire.amount"",""state"":""passed"",""findingOrdinals"":[]},{""ruleId"":""wire.debit-account"",""state"":""passed"",""findingOrdinals"":[]},{""ruleId"":""wire.account-type"",""state"":""passed"",""findingOrdinals"":[]},{""ruleId"":""wire.address"",""state"":""passed"",""findingOrdinals"":[]},{""ruleId"":""wire.country"",""state"":""not-applicable"",""findingOrdinals"":[]},{""ruleId"":""wire.bank"",""state"":""passed"",""findingOrdinals"":[]},{""ruleId"":""wire.charges"",""state"":""not-applicable"",""findingOrdinals"":[]},{""ruleId"":""wire.fx"",""state"":""not-applicable"",""findingOrdinals"":[]},{""ruleId"":""huntington-csv-wire-public-2026-r1.non-empty-source"",""state"":""passed"",""findingOrdinals"":[]}]}","","","",""
