-structure"",""severity"":""ERROR"",""applicability"":""Descriptions containing REVERSAL without regard to case; other descriptions are not applicable."",""prerequisite"":""Trusted record envelopes"",""reference"":""docs/ACH_ORIGINATION_EXPANDED.md; https://achdevguide.nacha.org/ach-file-details; https://achdevguide.nacha.org/ach-file-overview; https://developer.gs.com/docs/services/transaction-banking/ach-file/; Nacha ISO mapping guide 2023-08-09; source-reviewed candidate"",""evidence"":""tests/nacha-expanded.test.ts; tests/nacha-expanded-fixtures.test.ts; demo-files/nacha-expanded/manifest.json; independent source/fixture review recorded in docs/ACH_ORIGINATION_EXPANDED.md; no business approvals or hosted acceptance""},{""id"":""nacha.reversal-transaction"",""description"":""Reversals are monetary; loan debit 55 requires uppercase REVERSAL; original matching and deadlines remain unverified."",""ruleClass"":""nacha-structure"",""severity"":""ERROR"",""applicability"":""Declared reversals or code 55 with known entry types."",""prerequisite"":""Trusted record envelopes; known transaction type"",""reference"":""docs/ACH_ORIGINATION_EXPANDED.md; https://achdevguide.nacha.org/ach-file-details; https://achdevguide.nacha.org/ach-file-overview; https://developer.gs.com/docs/services/transaction-banking/ach-file/; Nacha ISO mapping guide 2023-08-09; source-reviewed candidate"",""evidence"":""tests/nacha-expanded.test.ts; tests/nacha-expanded-fixtures.test.ts; demo-files/nacha-expanded/manifest.json; independent source/fixture review recorded in docs/ACH_ORIGINATION_EXPANDED.md; no business approvals or hosted acceptance""},{""id"":""nacha.remittance-required"",""description"":""Zero-dollar remittance and live CTX entries require addenda; prenotes do not require associated live-entry addenda."",""ruleClass"":""nacha-structure"",""severity"":""ERROR"",""applicability"":""Known remittance entry types and live CTX; other entries not applicable."",""prerequisite"":""Trusted record envelopes; known transaction type"",""reference"":""docs/ACH_ORIGINATION_EXPANDED.md; https://achdevguide.nacha.org/ach-file-details; https://achdevguide.nacha.org/ach-file-overview; https://developer.gs.com/docs/services/transaction-banking/ach-file/; Nacha ISO mapping guide 2023-08-09; source-reviewed candidate"",""evidence"":""tests/nacha-expanded.test.ts; tests/nacha-expanded-fixtures.test.ts; demo-files/nacha-expanded/manifest.json; independent source/fixture review recorded in docs/ACH_ORIGINATION_EXPANDED.md; no business approvals or hosted acceptance""},{""id"":""nacha.ctx-remittance"",""description"":""CTX X12 payload is reassembled without stripping chunk-boundary spaces; transaction sets contain BPR/BPS with envelope count/reference checks."",""ruleClass"":""nacha-structure"",""severity"":""ERROR"",""applicability"":""Present CTX type-05 addenda; UN/EDIFACT and opt-in XML produce unsupported runs pending qualification."",""prerequisite"":""Trusted record envelopes; payment addenda type known"",""reference"":""docs/ACH_ORIGINATION_EXPANDED.md; https://achdevguide.nacha.org/ach-file-details; https://achdevguide.nacha.org/ach-file-overview; https://developer.gs.com/docs/services/transaction-banking/ach-file/; Nacha ISO mapping guide 2023-08-09; source-reviewed candidate"",""evidence"":""tests/nacha-expanded.test.ts; tests/nacha-expanded-fixtures.test.ts; demo-files/nacha-expanded/manifest.json; independent source/fixture review recorded in docs/ACH_ORIGINATION_EXPANDED.md; no business approvals or hosted acceptance""},{""id"":""nacha.description-case"",""description"":""Declared standardized Company Entry Description fields are uppercase, including alphabetic suffixes; PAYROLL has three discretionary suffix columns."",""ruleClass"":""nacha-structure"",""severity"":""ERROR"",""applicability"":""Recognized standardized descriptors, including case-insensitive declarations."",""prerequisite"":""Trusted record envelopes"",""reference"":""docs/ACH_ORIGINATION_R2.md; https://www.nacha.org/rules/risk-management-topics-company-entry-descriptions (effective 2026-03-20); supplied September 2026 Basic Supplement pp. 4-5 and 2026 Basic p. 92; https://www.cms.gov/regulations-and-guidance/guidance/transmittals/downloads/r1351otn.pdf (TRN structural corroboration, 2014)"",""evidence"":""tests/nacha-origination-r2.test.ts; candidate structural evidence only; no business approvals or hosted acceptance""},{""id"":""nacha.description-sec"",""description"":""Declared PAYROLL is PPD credit; PURCHASE is WEB or permitted TEL debit; HCCLAIMPMT is CCD. Real purpose/standing authorization is unverified."",""ruleClass"":""nacha-structure"",""severity"":""ERROR"",""applicability"":""Recognized declarations with known SEC and entry type for direction checks."",""prerequisite"":""Trusted record envelopes; known SEC/entry type where needed"",""reference"":""docs/ACH_ORIGINATION_R2.md; https://www.nacha.org/rules/risk-management-topics-company-entry-descriptions (effective 2026-03-20); supplied September 2026 Basic Supplement pp. 4-5 and 2026 Basic p. 92; https://www.cms.gov/regulations-and-guidance/guidance/transmittals/downloads/r1351otn.pdf (TRN structural corroboration, 2014)"",""evidence"":""tests/nacha-origination-r2.test.ts; candidate structural evidence only; no business approvals or hosted acceptance""},{""id"":""nacha.healthcare-addenda"",""description"":""Declared healthcare CCD entries require addenda and indicator 1 except prenotes."",""ruleClass"":""nacha-structure"",""severity"":""ERROR"",""applicability"":""HCCLAIMPMT CCD entries with known non-prenote transaction type."",""prerequisite"":""Trusted record envelopes; known entry type"",""reference"":""docs/ACH_ORIGINATION_R2.md; https://www.nacha.org/rules/risk-management-topics-company-entry-descriptions (effective 2026-03-20); supplied September 2026 Basic Supplement pp. 4-5 and 2026 Basic p. 92; https://www.cms.gov/regulations-and-guidance/guidance/transmittals/downloads/r1351otn.pdf (TRN structural corroboration, 2014)"",""evidence"":""tests/nacha-origination-r2.test.ts; candidate structural evidence only; no business approvals or hosted acceptance""},{""id"":""nacha.healthcare-trn"",""description"":""Declared healthcare CCD payment addenda contain a complete reassociation TRN segment ending in tilde or backslash; payload locations are contextual; full 835 guide conformance is excluded."",""ruleClass"":""nacha-structure"",""severity"":""ERROR"",""applicability"":""HCCLAIMPMT CCD non-prenotes with present type-05 addenda."",""prerequisite"":""Trusted record envelopes; known entry type and payment addenda type"",""reference"":""docs/ACH_ORIGINATION_R2.md; https://www.nacha.org/rules/risk-management-topics-company-entry-descriptions (effective 2026-03-20); supplied September 2026 Basic Supplement pp. 4-5 and 2026 Basic p. 92; https://www.cms.gov/regulations-and-guidance/guidance/transmittals/downloads/r1351otn.pdf (TRN structural corroboration, 2014)"",""evidence"":""tests/nacha-origination-r2.test.ts; candidate structural evidence only; no business approvals or hosted acceptance""}],""exclusions"":[""CANDIDATE public-source implementation only; no full 2026 Rules compliance, production approval, hosted ReadMe acceptance or bank acceptance."",""No account validity, routing-directory membership, authorization, real purpose/eligibility, funds availability, settlement, live windows or submission."",""No original-entry matching, historical duplicates, reversal purpose or deadlines, cross-file comparison, MAC authentication or complete X12/healthcare/tax business-guide conformance."",""UN/EDIFACT and opt-in XML CTX payloads, plus WEB/TEL loan combinations, are source/qualification gated: unsupported runs carry no verdict."",""Other origination SECs, returns/NOCs, external facts and future amendments are outside this origination profile."",""Healthcare classification is declared only by HCCLAIMPMT. Missing descriptors do not prove absence of health