-structure"",""severity"":""ERROR"",""applicability"":""Descriptions containing REVERSAL without regard to case; other descriptions are not applicable."",""prerequisite"":""Trusted record envelopes"",""reference"":""docs/ACH_ORIGINATION_EXPANDED.md; https://achdevguide.nacha.org/ach-file-details; https://achdevguide.nacha.org/ach-file-overview; https://developer.gs.com/docs/services/transaction-banking/ach-file/; Nacha ISO mapping guide 2023-08-09; source-reviewed candidate"",""evidence"":""tests/nacha-expanded.test.ts; tests/nacha-expanded-fixtures.test.ts; demo-files/nacha-expanded/manifest.json; independent source/fixture review recorded in docs/ACH_ORIGINATION_EXPANDED.md; no business approvals or hosted acceptance""},{""id"":""nacha.reversal-transaction"",""description"":""Reversals are monetary; loan debit 55 requires uppercase REVERSAL; original matching and deadlines remain unverified."",""ruleClass"":""nacha-structure"",""severity"":""ERROR"",""applicability"":""Declared reversals or code 55 with known entry types."",""prerequisite"":""Trusted record envelopes; known transaction type"",""reference"":""docs/ACH_ORIGINATION_EXPANDED.md; https://achdevguide.nacha.org/ach-file-details; https://achdevguide.nacha.org/ach-file-overview; https://developer.gs.com/docs/services/transaction-banking/ach-file/; Nacha ISO mapping guide 2023-08-09; source-reviewed candidate"",""evidence"":""tests/nacha-expanded.test.ts; tests/nacha-expanded-fixtures.test.ts; demo-files/nacha-expanded/manifest.json; independent source/fixture review recorded in docs/ACH_ORIGINATION_EXPANDED.md; no business approvals or hosted acceptance""},{""id"":""nacha.remittance-required"",""description"":""Zero-dollar remittance and live CTX entries require addenda; prenotes do not require associated live-entry addenda."",""ruleClass"":""nacha-structure"",""severity"":""ERROR"",""applicability"":""Known remittance entry types and live CTX; other entries not applicable."",""prerequisite"":""Trusted record envelopes; known transaction type"",""reference"":""docs/ACH_ORIGINATION_EXPANDED.md; https://achdevguide.nacha.org/ach-file-details; https://achdevguide.nacha.org/ach-file-overview; https://developer.gs.com/docs/services/transaction-banking/ach-file/; Nacha ISO mapping guide 2023-08-09; source-reviewed candidate"",""evidence"":""tests/nacha-expanded.test.ts; tests/nacha-expanded-fixtures.test.ts; demo-files/nacha-expanded/manifest.json; independent source/fixture review recorded in docs/ACH_ORIGINATION_EXPANDED.md; no business approvals or hosted acceptance""},{""id"":""nacha.ctx-remittance"",""description"":""CTX X12 payload is reassembled without stripping chunk-boundary spaces; transaction sets contain BPR/BPS with envelope count/reference checks."",""ruleClass"":""nacha-structure"",""severity"":""ERROR"",""applicability"":""Present CTX type-05 addenda; UN/EDIFACT and opt-in XML produce unsupported runs pending qualification."",""prerequisite"":""Trusted record envelopes; payment addenda type known"",""reference"":""docs/ACH_ORIGINATION_EXPANDED.md; https://achdevguide.nacha.org/ach-file-details; https://achdevguide.nacha.org/ach-file-overview; https://developer.gs.com/docs/services/transaction-banking/ach-file/; Nacha ISO mapping guide 2023-08-09; source-reviewed candidate"",""evidence"":""tests/nacha-expanded.test.ts; tests/nacha-expanded-fixtures.test.ts; demo-files/nacha-expanded/manifest.json; independent source/fixture review recorded in docs/ACH_ORIGINATION_EXPANDED.md; no business approvals or hosted acceptance""},{""id"":""nacha.description-case"",""description"":""Declared standardized Company Entry Description fields are uppercase, including alphabetic suffixes; PAYROLL has three discretionary suffix columns."",""ruleClass"":""nacha-structure"",""severity"":""ERROR"",""applicability"":""Recognized standardized descriptors, including case-insensitive declarations."",""prerequisite"":""Trusted record envelopes"",""reference"":""docs/ACH_ORIGINATION_