ot a complete approved 2026 ruleset"",""evidence"":""tests/nacha-parser.test.ts; tests/nacha-fixtures.test.ts; tests/nacha-coverage.test.ts; demo-files/nacha/manifest.json; synthetic local evidence, not independent business approval or hosted/bank acceptance""},{""id"":""nacha.file-credit"",""description"":""File numeric credit total equals interpreted entry amounts in exact integer cents; debit/credit equality is not required."",""ruleClass"":""nacha-structure"",""severity"":""ERROR"",""applicability"":""Selected profile nacha-origination-public-2026 (origination-public-2026). File with interpretable amounts and supported directions in every batch; otherwise not evaluated."",""prerequisite"":""nacha.framing and nacha.ascii passed; nacha.record-order passed (framing, ASCII or order errors stop downstream field evaluation); all file amounts numeric and transaction directions supported"",""reference"":""docs/NACHA_SOURCE_REVIEW.md; https://achdevguide.nacha.org/ach-file-overview; https://achdevguide.nacha.org/ach-file-details; https://www.firstcitizens.com/content/dam/firstcitizens/pdfs/commercial/commercial-advantage/nacha-file-specs.pdf (revision 02/2024, CTX layouts); public-source subset, not a complete approved 2026 ruleset"",""evidence"":""tests/nacha-parser.test.ts; tests/nacha-fixtures.test.ts; tests/nacha-coverage.test.ts; demo-files/nacha/manifest.json; synthetic local evidence, not independent business approval or hosted/bank acceptance""},{""id"":""nacha.non-empty-source"",""description"":""The admitted source contains non-whitespace text."",""ruleClass"":""tool-policy"",""severity"":""ERROR"",""applicability"":""Selected profile nacha-origination-public-2026 (origination-public-2026). Selected NACHA profile after trusted parser context is available."",""prerequisite"":""nacha.framing and nacha.ascii passed; nacha.record-order passed (framing, ASCII or order errors stop downstream field evaluation)"",""reference"":""docs/NACHA_SOURCE_REVIEW.md; https://achdevguide.nacha.org/ach-file-overview; https://achdevguide.nacha.org/ach-file-details; https://www.firstcitizens.com/content/dam/firstcitizens/pdfs/commercial/commercial-advantage/nacha-file-specs.pdf (revision 02/2024, CTX layouts); public-source subset, not a complete approved 2026 ruleset"",""evidence"":""tests/nacha-parser.test.ts; tests/nacha-fixtures.test.ts; tests/nacha-coverage.test.ts; demo-files/nacha/manifest.json; synthetic local evidence, not independent business approval or hosted/bank acceptance""}],""exclusions"":[""CANDIDATE public-source subset only. No production approval, full 2026 Operating Rules compliance, bank acceptance, funds availability, or execution guarantee."",""No customer authorization, consent, account existence or eligibility, fraud approval, or real transaction-purpose verification; purpose-dependent PAYROLL/PURCHASE requirements are not established."",""Routing syntax, prefix and checksum do not verify bank routing-directory membership or external account/payment details."",""No holiday calendar, transmission cutoff, bank processing window, live-date qualification, or actual settlement verification."",""No historical or cross-file duplicate detection; trace uniqueness applies only within the admitted file."",""No MAC authentication or validation of embedded EDI, UN/EDIFACT, tax, healthcare, or other remittance content semantics."",""Only ordinary monetary CCD, PPD, CTX, WEB and TEL originations using transaction codes 22/27/32/37/52; other SEC/account codes, prenotes, zero-dollar remittance entries, returns/NOCs and reversals are outside the profile. Case-insensitive REVERSAL markers anywhere in the description produce UNSUPPORTED with no verdict (malformed-case admission is conservative tool policy)."",""Field checks cover numeric syntax, constants, reserved spaces and required values, not complete alphabetic-field semantic validation or bank-specific identifier/padding policies.""],""checks"":[{""ruleId"":""nacha.framing"",""sta